WEBVTT

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.190
I can't believe the test is tomorrow.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.860
You mean the math test?

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.270
Yeah.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.400
Now I'm depressed.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.120
It's freezing!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.410
Huh?

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.500
Oh yeah.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.700
Ah, welcome back.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.470
Nanami-san.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.530
Are you done moving?

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.120
Yes, just now. Happy to be your housemate.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:43.690
Same here.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.120
Sorry to do this, but I have to go to work.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.150
I'll be coming home late, so be sure to lock the doors.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.280
See you later.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:56.690
Oh, I also set up that thing in the tatami room.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:57.700
What thing?

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.450
Something to keep you warm.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.180
A kotatsu.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.690
It's cold.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:52.010
Nobody's turned on the switch yet.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.150
Now it's starting to get warm.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:07.920
Thank you.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.500
Yes.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.370
Now here's your next question.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.280
Okay.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.840
The main character of the popular mecha anime

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:15.260
<i>Space Legend Moonrise, </i>which aired in the nineties,

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.740
used a magical baton called what?

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.690
Go, Matsuzaki-san!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.000
Kamenokouji Teruo!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:20.660
Correct!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:23.270
Well, everybody knows <i>that.</i>

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.890
This is heaven.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.990
Mitsuki?

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:32.650
Hey! Mitsuki-san?

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.480
I know!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.570
I can study for my test in here!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:42.500
Won't a kotatsu be too much of a distraction?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.160
It'll be fine. My room's too cold anyway.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.440
I'm home!

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.320
So she's back.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.170
Actually, today's supposed to be
the day Nanami-<i>san moves in.</i>

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:08.810
Who's that?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.390
Ow!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.100
What are you doing?

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.260
I lost my eraser under here.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.480
I was trying to get it.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.530
God, you made me hit my head.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.950
I see.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.660
Don't talk with your butt!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.380
So what's up? Doing some homework in here?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.270
Yeah.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.520
Am I not supposed to?

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.700
Well, you certainly can...

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.910
Where's Nanami-san?

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.250
At work. She'll be late.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.240
Oh, really?

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.530
Don't turn up the heat too high.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.390
I wonder if he saw my panties.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.620
I've always known Mitsuki can be a few bulbs short of a chandelier.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.480
So...

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.830
Striped panties, huh?

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:32.570
Hey, don't yawn. That'll just make me sleepy.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.780
But I'm still sleepy since it's so toasty in here.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:40.050
I'll give you that. But why would a ghost ever get sleepy?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.590
Maybe a little nap...

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.290
A kotatsu?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.660
We haven't used that in a long while.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.070
Huh. When was <i>the last time I used it?</i>

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.910
I know I used it as a kid... but when?

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.810
Hey, what do you want for din...

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:22.020
When did she come to visit?

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.230
Are they studying together?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.590
I guess they are<i> into each other.</i>

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.400
She got most of them wrong.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.130
She's bad at math? Who knew?

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:21.420
Actually, how many years has it been since I shared a kotatsu with someone?

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.390
A kotatsu?

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.090
When was that?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.330
Dad was there...

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:32.350
Ah.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:35.890
And this... must be Mom.

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:41.290
Something's... crushing me.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.890
It's like something's wrapped tightly around me.

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:49.940
Oh yeah.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.030
I shouldn't sleep under a kotatsu-

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.700
What the? Is that Hiyori?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.360
It's not!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.170
So, that means...

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.090
Oh no!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:12.800
He means nothing! I couldn't care less about him. But...

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.560
I thought he was at least decent enough not to do this!

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:18.930
...om.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:25.080
Mom, I feel... full.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.000
Hey!

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.320
Ow... That hurt, Mom.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:36.260
God, are you for real? Who are you calling your mom?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:44.150
I've always known he can be very stupid sometimes.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.550
It's been corrected.

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:56.210
That means he saw all my wrong answers?

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.810
Mom...

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:00.050
I am <i>not</i> your mother!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.030
Ah, um....

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.590
Boy, did I sleep.

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:22.930
Oh, did I fall asleep here?

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:28.130
Um, so....

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.970
You corrected this, right?

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.090
Th-Thanks.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.550
What's so funny?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.500
What did you expect? I'm bad at math!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.420
Besides, you didn't have to do this!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.770
No, it's just...

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.480
I think it's great how we can share a kotatsu.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.380
What's wrong? Your face is all red.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.820
Only because of that kotatsu!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.720
Should I keep helping you?

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.530
No thanks!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.610
Oh, did that friend of yours leave?

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.560
Friend? What are you talking about?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.630
Sleeping at that kotatsu sapped my energy!

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.150
Do ghosts ever lose energy?

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:25.980
WHITE CREAM STEW IN FIVE
MEAT & VEGETABLE STIR-FRY

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.440
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.960
Geez, Hiyori, don't scare me!

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:44.090
You're like a newlywed who's
making lunch for her husband.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:48.030
Do you really like making bentos
for Onii-chan <i>that</i> much?

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.710
Do I like...?

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.460
No, it's only because I'm getting <i>your</i> vibes!

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:57.190
Anyway, I only like it as a personal hobby.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.430
His bento was just an afterthought!

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:05.610
I think she's starting to change her attitude toward Yuuya-<i>oniichan these days.</i>

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.980
Even if we are<i> in sync...</i>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.400
Oh yeah, I still have to get his box.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:17.500
Huh, I thought he came home.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.860
His book bag is still here. Maybe he went to his room.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:23.370
Go ahead. Open it.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.810
I can't do that!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.950
Here!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.570
I think I'll get his bento box!

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:32.930
Don't do it!

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:35.130
Don't worry, it'll be cool.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:42.600
Another bento box that's not mine?

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:48.520
I don't recognize the cloth on this big one.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.140
Well, I'll let you take care of those.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.170
That's weird. Onii-chan didn't eat much.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.580
What about this?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.780
He couldn't make it more obvious
which one he liked better.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.470
I'm never making him anything again!

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:17.420
You were the one who made that bento, Yukina-san?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.050
Yes, starting today.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.590
Yuu-kun said he makes his own lunch.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.790
So I thought I would make them for him instead.

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.640
If you want, I can make yours too-

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:32.600
Then I guess he'll be having your lunch from now on.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:38.630
It appears he doesn't think my lunch is good enough.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.070
Mitsuki-chan?

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.030
So it <i>is</i> you, Yuki-nee.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.510
Hey there! I let myself in.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.290
Oh, thanks for the lunch.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.250
It was good. I ate all of it.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:57.210
Mitsuki, what's the matter?

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:01.880
Whoa, she looks pissed.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.050
Oh, here's an idea!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.560
If you haven't started dinner yet,
why don't I make something?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.580
Come on, I can't make you do that.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.650
It'll be no problem.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:18.080
Torii-kun is also here. It'll be fun if we all eat together.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:21.280
You mean it?! We get to eat your food?!

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.630
Hey, you can help me, Mitsuki-chan!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.950
No, I'm good-

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.240
All right, bring it on!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.660
Stop this, Hiyori!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.030
I don't want to make food with her!

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:43.920
Look, I want to get hot and heavy with Onii-chan and get into Heaven.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:48.800
I have to fill the heart gauge and make those steps toward the gate.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:54.770
But my food was so nasty that
he hardly even touched it.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.730
All the more reason...

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:57.550
to prove yourself to him!

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.250
Hey, stop doing that!
to prove yourself to him!

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:05.690
If Miss Funbags finally wins over Yuuya-
oniichan, that will be the end for us.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:09.250
He needs to think you're the perfect woman for him.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.370
In order for that to happen, we'll need to wear this!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.830
I-Is that...?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.290
I'm a lucky guy.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.960
Two girls are making food, just for me!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.660
It's nothing special.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.590
It'll just be a normal meal.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.270
What you said just pissed me off.

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.350
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.680
At <i>my</i> house...

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.950
Ah, I'm starving.

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.930
Is there anything to eat?

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.980
So go outside and eat the
weeds growing in our lawn.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.060
That's not food!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.340
Then go buy some seaweed.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.570
It's good for baldness.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.280
I'm not going bald!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.160
I'm not, right?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:51.890
Right?

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.810
Yeah, is this going somewhere?

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.470
What I'm saying is you've got
it good! You just don't know it!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.210
Wait, don't tell me...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.930
Onii-chan, we're having curry today.

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:10.680
I'm not sure if it's good enough.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.370
Welcome back, Yuu-kun.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.140
Will you have dinner? A bath?

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:19.000
Or do you want to have <i>me</i> first?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.550
And she does that every day,
wearing a Naked Apron!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:24.750
Keep dreaming.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.570
And what the hell is a “Naked Apron”?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:31.120
Don't you know? It's where a girl
wears nothing but an apron-

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.570
Yow...

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.290
Where are you headed?

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.140
I'm going to peek in.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.500
Ah, Yuuya-oniichan!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.210
What is it?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.880
Oh, right. Just getting a drink.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.150
Sure, wait here! I'll get you something.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.040
He's watching!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.390
He looks really weirded out to me.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.620
But you were the one who bought this apron, Mitsuki.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.980
I thought it looked cute back at the shop.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.190
Yuu-kun!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.950
If you'd like, why don't you take a bath first.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.030
It's going to take us a little while longer.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.440
Hey! Isn't that what a wife tells her husband?!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:21.160
She thinks she's married to him?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.670
I already drew a bath, so it's all ready for you.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.100
Now look here!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.130
God!

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.790
Give it a rest, Hiyori!

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:29.840
Mitsuki?

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.340
Um...

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.390
She's right!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:37.140
You're only getting in our way,
so why don't you take that bath?

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:41.600
Yeah, but Torii's here too. I'll take one later.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:49.140
I wonder if Yuu-kun came get some appetizers.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.890
It looked like he was only getting a drink.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.430
I wondered how they were getting along, but it looks fine from here.

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.960
Maybe I will take that bath.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.520
Yukina-san... that's amazing.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.630
What is?

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:18.480
You're handling everything all at once.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:21.350
You know your way around the kitchen, just like a pro.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:24.880
I'm not that good. I'm just used to doing this.

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:26.100
You are?

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:32.460
I used to be a latchkey kid. I had to make food for myself.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.610
What about you?

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:42.120
Before my mom remarried, I used to eat ready-
made meals whenever she came home late.

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:47.000
So I've only begun learning how to cook.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.920
But I still have a lot to learn.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.170
I see.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.460
But...

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:57.370
when I started making my own lunch, I found out that I like doing it.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:03.510
I knew it! You were making Yuu-kun's lunches!

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:07.080
We take turns only because it's unfair otherwise!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.550
So I stuck nose where it didn't belong.

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:12.050
Yuu-kun could have said something.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.710
You didn't do anything wrong!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:16.900
He ate everything in your bento.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:22.370
But he hardly even touched... my lunch.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.190
You're overreacting!

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:31.210
It's only because he was full, I'm sure of it!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.320
You're so adorable, Mitsuki-chan!
You don't even try to hide it!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.800
Hey, Yukina-san!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.760
Actually, Yuu-kun was talking about you.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:46.170
He said you were now making food for him.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.230
And it made him blush.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:55.650
Yuu-kun had to do everything around the
house since his dad was so busy with work.

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:01.460
I think he's glad you're making meals for him.

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:04.410
It won't matter how it tastes.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:10.980
Is that true?

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:14.290
Does this<i> actually make him sort of happy?</i>

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.980
What are you saying?

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:19.100
If it doesn't taste good, he won't eat it!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.980
Shut up! This is none of your business!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:25.410
But if Onii-chan's happy anyway, then it's all good!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.810
All we have to do is make something
so tasty he'll eat every bite!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.270
Hey!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.940
You'll see, Onii-chan!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.500
Yes! That's the spirit!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.860
Being a good cook takes practice.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.000
Mitsuki-chan!

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.000
Oww...

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.040
Sorry, Mitsuki-chan.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.550
I don't believe this!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.510
Why did she leave that thing open?!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.280
Yukina-san didn't do it on purpose.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:10.660
What? Are you starting to <i>accept</i> Miss Funbags?

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:13.230
Then that means she has the advantage.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:21.650
Fine, I'll just take it up a notch,

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:24.870
and seduce him wearing this!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.870
Hey! You idiot!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:30.740
I can't walk out of here in <i>this!</i>

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.090
Now I get it!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.530
So <i>that's</i> the Naked Apron!

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:53.750
What?

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:56.260
She threw away the lunch she made?

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:59.420
I was too full at lunch, so I was
saving it for later tonight.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:05.690
Okay, so that's why she was so moody.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:07.350
So what's with the swollen cheek?

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.980
Nothing to worry about.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.650
I don't think that slap ruined their chances.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.360
Wait, don't tell me...

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.290
Geez, that again? Lay off.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.000
Mitsuki-chan slapped you
But from the looks of it, they're far from being in love—I think.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.290
because you caught her wearing a Naked Apron

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.260
after getting out of the tub!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.380
We've gotten really close to the gate!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:30.970
Just a few more steps, and we'll reach it!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:37.100
You and Onii-chan are finally starting to click, so let's keep making those steps!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.980
Hey, are you listening, Mitsuki?

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.680
Why did <i>that</i> fill up the gauge?

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:46.490
Just <i>why?</i>

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.860
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:56.460
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.340
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.220
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:15.540
I want you to notice

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:18.780
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:21.080
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:24.240
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.610
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.830
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:32.090
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:35.170
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.800
These ordinary days

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:40.680
are something special to me.

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:46.180
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:51.900
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:57.320
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:00.030
You’re my man with the charming do

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:02.810
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.520
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:08.540
I love you very much.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:11.080
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.750
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:16.620
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.250
always and forever more.

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:24.000
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual!</i>

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.520
What could I do?

00:23:26.180 --> 00:23:28.260
I really don't
remember anything.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.510
You're the one who never
think things through!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.600
You can take it first.

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:36.060
This feels great!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:37.430
Screw you, Mitsuki!

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:40.020
Just a little more!
Hang on, Mitsuki!
